    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardWelcomeTitle">Welcome</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardWelcomeHelp">This assistant prepares a simple starting configuration. You can fine-tune everything later in settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardWelcomeBody">Audio Switcher lets you change Windows playback and recording devices from Playnite Desktop and Fullscreen, apply preferred devices when Playnite starts, and use optional Desktop top-bar and Fullscreen quick-switch controls.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardDevicesTitle">Preferred devices</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardDevicesHelp">Choose the output and input Audio Switcher should apply when Playnite starts. Game profiles can still override these temporarily.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardAccessTitle">Quick access</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardAccessHelp">Choose how Audio Switcher appears in Desktop and Fullscreen.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardDesktopHelp">Shows Audio Switcher in Playnite's Desktop top bar so you can open settings quickly and see the active device.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardSummaryTitle">Review and save</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCAS_SetupWizardSummaryHelp">Saving only updates Audio Switcher settings. Open Devices later to hide unused endpoints, set icons, or customize volumes.</sys:String>
